    <h2>Editor's take</h2>
    <p>A mass match confirms the molecule's weight, not its sequence. MS/MS is the step that turns 'the right mass' into 'the right peptide' — and it is the step most often skipped.</p>

    <h2>Limitations</h2>
    <p>This guide describes methods and interpretation, not acceptance limits. Limits must come from your own specification and, where applicable, the relevant pharmacopoeial monograph. No testing was performed by the author for this page.</p>

